@format 1
@id media-removal.in-global-interface
@title In Global interface
@section Media removal
@area In Global interface
@entry unload-current, unload-all
@summary Show global commands that clear media state from one workspace or all tab workspaces.
@related media-removal.common.workspace-media-clear
@tag media
@tag removal
@tag global

@alias window = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainWindow.PWindow
@alias workspace = Cadroue.UIShell.PControlBar.PWorkspace
@alias strip = Cadroue.UIShell.PControlBar.PStrip

[unload-current] Selected-workspace Unload command <input>
~ This starts with selected-workspace Unload command.
[Technical explanation]
- Dispatch Unload to the selected workspace; PWorkspaceMediaClear handles viewer, flow, Files, and grouping cleanup @ window.PShortcutMediaClose(...)
  @ workspace.PWorkspaceMediaClear(...)
> map:media-removal.common.workspace-media-clear

[unload-all] Unload All command <input>
~ This starts with unload All command.
[Technical explanation]
- Dispatch Unload All; PStripContentClear calls PWorkspaceMediaClear sequentially for every tab workspace @ window.PShortcutRun(...)
  @ strip.PStripContentClear(...)
> map:media-removal.common.workspace-media-clear
